<h2>Scenario B &mdash; map.addToBounds() (C-5)</h2>

<p>
    <code>Map.addToBounds()</code> is public API that takes an array, and
    <code>LatLngBounds.extend()</code> builds a <code>LatLng</code> for each entry. An application that
    collects its marker positions and fits the map to them goes through here, so set the count to your
    real marker count.
</p>

